      "{**22 NY3d at 47} OPINION OF THE COURT",
      "Defendant moved in the trial court, pursuant to CPL 330.30, to set aside his conviction for second degree weapon possession. The Court denied the motion and sentenced defendant to 3- years of imprisonment on the second degree count and one year on the third degree count, to run concurrently. The Appellate Division affirmed the judgment of conviction and sentence as to both counts, rejecting defendant's argument that his Second Amendment rights had been violated (, 83 AD3d 960 [2d Dept 2011]). A Judge of this Court granted leave to appeal (19 NY3d 961 [2012]), and we now affirm. "
